  "summary": "The PAX2D is a counter and rate meter with three counters, three rate channels, up to four setpoint outputs and an optional linear output card. Its serial port runs Modbus RTU or Modbus ASCII. This map covers the frequently used block (counts, rates, min/max, setpoints, scale factors, count loads, manual output control) and the counter mode, decimal point and scaling settings.",
